# NOTE (2026-08-04): this SHA is not yet on a public branch of provin.oss. Until
# it is, go.mod carries a `replace` to the sibling checkout in this agent scope
# and the pin records intent rather than a fetchable revision. Replace the
# directive with a normal `require` once the revision is pushed.
